	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"天の蒼穹を支える者―アトラスガンダム",
			"HGサンダーボルトシリーズについに降臨！",
			"アニメ第2シーズンに登場する主役機アトラスガンダムを特徴的な装備と共に立体化！",
			"背中のサブレッグはフレキシブルに可動し、各形態を再現可能！",
			"・漫画原作者 太田垣康男氏による”オリジナルデザインMS”のプロポーション＆ディティール感を再現",
			"・球体関節およびサブレッグによるダイナミックなアクションポーズを再現",
			"・肩部サーベルの収納ギミック再現",
			"・各種武装を同梱し地上戦フル装備の再現が可能",
			"・所属部隊マークとパーソナルマークをマーキングシールで再現"
		],
		"en": [
			"The one who supports the heavenly blue sky - Atlas Gundam",
			"Finally arriving in the HG Thunderbolt series!",
			"The main character Atlas Gundam that appears in the second season of the anime is now three-dimensional with its distinctive equipment!",
			"The sub-legs on the back can be flexibly moved and various forms can be reproduced!",
			"・Reproduces the proportions and details of the \"original design MS\" by manga author Yasuo Otagaki",
			"・Reproduce dynamic action poses with ball joints and sub-legs",
			"・Reproduction of shoulder saber storage gimmick",
			"・It is possible to reproduce the full ground battle equipment by including various weapons.",
			"・Reproduce your unit mark and personal mark with MarkingSeal"
		]
	},
